  "description": "Maximize your truck's storage space with this custom-fit underseat storage box, designed specifically for 2015-2025 Ford F150 and 2017-2024 Super Duty SuperCrew/Crew Cab models. Crafted from durable upgraded PP material, this organizer is perfect for keeping your truck essentials neatly stored and easily accessible. Installation is a breeze, requiring no tools and taking less than 3 minutes. Whether you’re storing tools, sports gear, or emergency supplies, this underseat storage box helps keep your truck organized and clutter-free.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Ford F150 & Super Duty: Designed to fit 2015-2025 F150 and 2017-2024 Super Duty SuperCrew/Crew Cab models (both with and without the factory subwoofer). A seamless and perfect fit that looks like it came straight from the factory.\nQuick and Easy Installation: No tools, no drilling—simply install in under 3 minutes by screwing into the designated holes. Enjoy hassle-free setup that saves you time and effort.\nUpgraded Durable PP Material: Made from high-quality PP material, this storage box is tough, long-lasting, and resistant to wear and tear. The black textured surface prevents items from sliding and is easy to clean with just a wipe.\nOrganized Storage with Dividers & Nylon Net: Features two dividers for organizing long items like tools or firearms, and a nylon net for holding small items securely. Keep everything neat and in place while on the go.\nVersatile Storage Space: Ideal for storing power tools, sports equipment, straps, first aid kits, and other essential accessories. Perfect for keeping your truck organized during travel or daily use.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nFit for: 2015-2026 Ford F-150 Supercrew Cab\nFits for 2017-2026 Ford F-250 F-350 F450 Super Duty SuperCREW Cab\nNot fits to Super Cab /Extended Cab / Regular Cab",
